            "jpgV2Prompt": "AI Agent Platform for Customer Communication & Workflow Automation\n\nWe are looking for an experienced Full-Stack Developer / AI Engineer to build a modular AI platform for automating customer emails, offer negotiations and internal workflows.\n\nCustomers send precious metals to us. An employee records weight and alloy in our existing internal pricing calculator, which returns the current maximum purchase value. The employee then sends an initial offer through the new dashboard.\n\nThe AI should analyse customer replies, classify whether the offer is accepted, rejected, questioned or requires negotiation, and generate a suitable response draft. During the learning phase, employees can approve, edit or reject each draft. Rejected drafts should be regenerated based on the stated reason.\n\nBefore every counteroffer, the AI must request a new valuation from our internal calculator, because precious-metal prices fluctuate. The AI must never calculate prices itself or use external pricing APIs.\n\nThe platform should include a central multi-brand dashboard, Gmail integration, configurable negotiation rules, payout and return queues, role management, API monitoring and an admin area that can be managed without programming knowledge.\n\nCommunication will take place in German. Relevant AI-agent and workflow-automation references are required. Long-term cooperation after launch is desired.",
